<!-- All texts of the touch UI. Labels in the XML use them with
     translation_tag="...", the firmware with lv_tr("..."). %1, %2, %3 are
     filled in by the firmware (numbers, names, times) - keep them in the text.
     (Not {1}: LVGL Pro reads a value in braces as an expression.)
     &#10; is a line break. To add a language, add its code to `languages`
     and an attribute with that code to every translation (missing ones fall
     back to the first language); the firmware uses the first language.
     Not in here: tab names and dropdown options (edit them in the XML files). -->
